3px;\"><strong>In Words:</strong> {{total_in_words}} Only</p><h3 style=\"margin: 20px 0 10px 0; font-size: 14px; text-align: center; background: #eee; border-top: 1px solid #999; border-bottom: 1px solid #999; padding: 5px; font-weight: bold;\">UPDATED FEE GROUP STATUS</h3>{{fee_group_breakdown_table}}<div style=\"margin-top: 20px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 2px solid #000; text-align: right; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">Student''s New Overall Balance Due: <span style=\"color: red;\">{{currency_symbol}}{{student_overall_balance_due}}</span></div><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-top: 30px;\"><img src=\"{{qr_code_url}}\" style=\"height: 70px;\"><div style=\"font-size: 12px; text-align: center;\"><p>This is a computer generated receipt. Does not require signature.</p><strong>PARENT COPY</strong></div><div style=\"width: 70px;\"></div></div></div>",
